                                                "sense_id": "24734768-3c5b-3c6f-b432-79199a210071",
                                                "text": "The gossiper, Emma wishes to control her receiver's of gossip (Harriet) opinion about Emma's marriage through setting Miss Bates, the gossipee, as a bad example to be followed in pursuing a dream of marriage."
